{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1391,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d5a2fd7ba0e938f53bd1b12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ういうい！よろぴく！\r\n思っきしフェスろ～ぜ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7bebc3b28c64c8c1ca48fd953efeec9fcaa5e3b0d4f92249765974b6f219a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e902d990e8e6a9b5841d07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ちょいちょいちょい！ヤバ！\r\nキミ熱すぎん！？\r\nもいっちょギア上げてかますべ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9614c3c77a5f950689dee8571ba066a7ed6e44319403caed1b07d215c6f4b7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ac1c285693d2e1b624d37ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安喔耶～☆\r\n今天也要度过超嗨的一天～！\r\n先大声喊出喔耶喔耶～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49960ac604b26ed462c70deb2597b6462ed8e1dee2e4251386221656e47847fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ae66e6a26aa16fa725214c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我起得比闹钟还要早！\r\n因为我太期待「明天」了～！\r\n光是活着就觉得嗨翻☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cf1b2eca8f9a3c9152596081f8ea49ef162381ff516251cb6cc38e324faed70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0318d67d04fe386c630a2321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "班上的同学都超温柔！\r\n艾尼和雷恩都会借我看笔记～\r\n而且都写得超整齐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d90e95b32ef6400a839fffb76ef00f310b983fda28925a5126ef89fb1b34bba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157328928e09adc661fe8b82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老师真的太关注我了☆\r\n我提议说干脆装个定位app，\r\n结果老师超生气～哭哭！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c10848e72c1594d33b1760a34a3f7dd4cb4d97aa4dbc8abb893a0099509c403",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5edfea13b3e4db01f50981c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～闹得好过瘾呢～！\r\n明天要更嗨，\r\n成为学园最疯的那个吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "76e114a885155a8077c3df8d1fb31b264f94423930d94fd274c6e113ae7a6ddd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8c09e0e4da5e22c71f8e7b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天感觉能睡得超香～！\r\n生野真的很强壮耶。\r\n我跟她跑到超越极限都没力了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c37017a9ef5997b30192b66e581297d8f27205b8b70acce33427371b847bbbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:025f3bb927f4bc4d127bd1ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生在哪里！？我想加LANE！\r\n还是干脆从顶楼把我的ID\r\n往楼下撒……不行吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad28bab2bcc760b2dabd426a30554389818d77267f6f734ff7eae416cbd0560",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab75c7e07db65206dc2db33c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶！属于我的季节到了～！\r\n总之先全部嗨一波。\r\n要去海边也要去山上……超嗨！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f591e57e24ead943ecd603e95314c95a28bdc8aca7bf67ee6cad8be17bae59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b237815e43b0b7f43069ab4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员～～大事不妙！！\r\n秋天的新商品全都太好吃了！！\r\n唔哇～会肥死～算了没差吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9608e5b3b29232a8e34bef29b30dbf39067ac54b89ba6df94be1eed5c4c7c90c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e577bc894974222fadcfba4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊！我必须去找奇迹！\r\n冬天她会冻得像冰块，很可怜～\r\n火热的我要负责抱她♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "53517bd906eb467b6fadd7094ddb9d436114f9cba670cf129b0ac617c9188278",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:077e78f6223437c44c8c9af8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とれぽよ☆おはぽよ☆ガチぽよ～！\r\nとりま朝イチ踊らん？的なチェケ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c86f280180bd5d17a1abbb3d37f150050bb1b06cf7cf86db52ce955681403d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a15f01ae4993da6509028e77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだ眠いマ！？\r\nあ、顔ガチったら目覚めんじゃん？\r\nりょ！ギャルメってあげゆ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b64d8a432dc6d04db0b4f2a3d126bda378bff78a058bbd70ea630b503ac0960e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1324a8c3c4ae6c43c95a5a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふわ～あふ…。\r\nやび。バカデカあくびった。\r\n…お嬢にはナイチョね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "76bb266e9907716d62b83f62d961ce8630260e1c4a8537be9792dc3bf4ee982f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51722d830c5aa0aab97bf1b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぇいうぇいハロぴ～！\r\nもう飯った？まだならトゥゲ希望☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fe6330206630f1251363f56977fc14187b00afa49338bca6d0529b813b43b13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe66827cce2c9f46df12057f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜になるのマジ秒！\r\nしょーみ踊り足りえんてぃ～。\r\n…ちら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d6aa565af39a3ae19558a28f01e4529666c67735713a532cd9cdd4ec3db0a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc55d28fe3a01c273ef1e4c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレぴおか＆おつー！\r\nこの時間までとかマジえら！\r\n偉すぎ謙信！よすよすザウルス☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "14a23a249fdd7deeee945687bdc7ce517b814918c52623d7b335a5d00bb9274a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d12949189bdfaf633866f517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドロワシーズンきちゃ！\r\n…ってことで、ト・レ・ぴ♡\r\n今日はウチと“デート”…しよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "380ab1b7a01352e6304890dc22f17e3a08561c06bd70a2a377d45295444e1084",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07a3e8f4c52ddaa5deb74852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏withウチ☆\r\nどどどどどーすんの？\r\nフェスすんべー☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7ef2035a951c1701908ddf1efea7d501cd90f3b335c46adb6d3cfc4a581b96c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea533868b4784e4daa3f950e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服マジデブれん！\r\nワンチャン太ももガチハムる！\r\n…ケド秋は一旦ギブで！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7662c81668c4f2a273e460cf9714d265e2c3214912202874c070891632358268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c28c9963c516f3876c9ff72b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヤバ！今日エグ寒くね！？\r\nムリムリザウルス！絶滅しゅる！\r\nプリズちゃんヘリ、温もりてぃ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef56d4afe9928a6acab36f2ae791b9eacfbfa28f547f68befe7bf5dfb1fd62d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4143fc110ee427bd484c6b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49ca4eb2b52dac0ea05c30ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6d8d9eca19623907ad62c3fee5b746e2a7886cd999191715aceca42bf64b29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdcf9a553613e28477c17421",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信不是很喜欢我吗？\r\n甚至可以说是爱了吧？\r\n那已经不是嗨不嗨的问题了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1c8c48c71329f5ed3950a31f45c0742e0f08f77a97d55a02cc993a2ded2d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9273632256c7bcef0ecd9765",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红宝石给人一种「大小姐！」的感觉，\r\n超级可爱的。即使她是高岭之花，\r\n我有天也会用超强跳跃抓住她～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba95814fc835c76c5095f79b8a68c27fb4041c577c9651ce46dfd3ca65ea2f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:954fa3056b3b7cda77cf74e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听我说！我的LANE好友数\r\n又快到上限了！\r\n看来只能升级成官方账号了～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc26ae99267fafaa9e711561d0a6ef7f32fe6c1be3edaa40092ddd00bb1069fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b7ff5a0ab4e249a204a1ea1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小矢真的很夸张耶！\r\n她之前……啊，小矢是我的阿姨！\r\n她这个人真的很不得了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "690d2788c33779f3e7903fa717ebd88c5657f1253d14a136de554c8266a2415e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c1a6a8bf4d4f17d6699a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "佐敦真的很搞笑！\r\n她之前鞋跟断掉时，居然想用\r\n朋友的双眼皮胶水黏起来～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd6fe6daec5b229326e6eafc1e0788acad75c887249e06b0f010143707e0c395",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcc9490e665e67ebaff7d7af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家很难得像这样都一样吧！？\r\n这一定要拍一张照！！\r\n训练员，叫大家集合～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82754d85f1f11f8943fc23c0d841668f132d8f85aa79f10b613e31f75620dcaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52822d0047ca470d1490d442",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "设计师真是内行！\r\n肚脐就是要露出来才行☆\r\n因为里面充满了爱与和平！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41fb751b7320be249b456f7da2e344e14699922398934850bb47aac4b6cff7a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a17b3bdf871a7e3ad85ecc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不想舍弃街头感，\r\n但该有的亮点还是不能少。\r\n所以有种大改造的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee1fa66b5f63ec4099ee25f72710775df6c27c1762ff0358b9b8acb1da05b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a5a472a11cd2ad4e97ecbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本来打扮得更华丽，\r\n但被老师吐槽说「你是镜球啊！」\r\n让我笑到放弃了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce3fd2159a8ff1bda647de5bbb4a794749c6d7b5df2da1319758231defbe3761",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:876b1b6ccfae8790106073ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，计划？我都要看心情耶！\r\n总之看起来有趣的全都试试，\r\n凭感觉嗨起来就是我的计划☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab53b9f95fa9839c1a17a44ba966335c2fa9c1aeb95a60e0d4e271bcaeeb38a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6866054fbe67f30f65094e48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不妙！又忘记吃饭了！\r\n跟涡轮一起嗨过头～！干脆\r\n跟她组成DJ&表演者搭档吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac54d49157f44a9d6bbe1add4e10b75aaa4e7fe9065daceecdf8500f0459fa0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2896fd26ba6b019cfe43a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的梦话已经跟醒着说话差不多了。\r\n而且会笑还会唱歌未免太嗨了吧？\r\n真喜欢我自己☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba1b796bfdc6b1cf891596bf8a2ac80c06a42a27a9242d478c3d9dab27737e68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd256510d6257d4e9f60a02c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸～要怎么调查花的名字呀？\r\n我刚才看到一种颜色超深的红花～\r\n很有大小姐的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6696bd81522d882576f9ce6cf927d11c4f7431a6122ccd1d7b79bc18336819c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45afbcf1ad763ff8096a336b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，我又买新泳装了☆\r\n不过没关系吧！因为我真的超爱去\r\n海边的！最好每次去都穿不一样♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aba883857261ee7ab21d3d9c058ab60376f4d3636febb1407727a2738ac914a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72167a6fa0be36edb3a73b47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用小花儿收集的落叶烤番薯！\r\n进进王也来客串☆\r\n我们要让火焰直冲天空～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6cfec28abaffcf302d12e6c047843c71e6ea2fdab72013cee04835545a86222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6152a369d3cf10dc74029a67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也收到挑战书了──！\r\n跟青竹的打雪仗祭典超热血～！\r\n我和善信组成的神搭档绝对要赢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "eacbc8328b853a99f8d6b09547851a5ff802163fe146bbf1c874ccf7999e654a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab9e4fc78f47422c621d75c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぴえん…部屋のミラボ…\r\n寮母たんにとらりた…。\r\nタピヘリハウスの宝が…おろろ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71bac528ef49fa9fd8105abe82bfde145ce9ed0d963c8e5a0ef05469bc0babb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44722753b3eed777241278fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヤバイトレぴ…ウチのズッ友、\r\nダンス神んちゅかもしれん…。\r\nリード爆イケ。ガチ惚れる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeca64c43ef2cf7d89749efec03d28395e27626dd53649ac9a0c4492b9c6195e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc9d2ddcadf26d6b515eef74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パパママに衣装見せたら、\r\nお遊戯会？の動画きたん！\r\nウチエグ笑っててガチ笑った☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf4858a9e1a33a791532816832c151dc5c4e99d6d623ce10e327bf0c5f20e982",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af98a1ea36e9c424d6fd6ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お嬢の手エグちぃちゃい！かわち！\r\n…ってゆったら、道場行って\r\n秒で投げられた…強い…しゅき…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f22d798014904755e39e25818dc87c5643a7fa677221a4c085de68422c10988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93c0f670b68e048a6ffd22ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ケイちゃんミラちゃんにさ、\r\n後ろからハグるっしょ？\r\n絶対フフって笑うん。超幸～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc4c3ebcfd57c33d7dc972a6be3a40ec173d0a225d1358b696bc712678ade0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:240524c02477a089d7f311a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "っしゃー！今日も爆ワラ！\r\nか・ま・せー！…ってことで！\r\nとりま反省文パスってくる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3b4d7a2b71db8e6dca0d87f78c9e4cc76f66808a53ba15f756e9716878afe59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e72077430b527f1a6952f69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレぴ！今日の放課後、暇んちゅ？\r\nプチドロワフェスっから、\r\n参加よろたの☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5628977d5313fd418d21c8f3007768ebb10f3ced37a559a618216cfe7c19dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aace34f7a83571d93e9f81d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ん～あ！今日も鬼騒ぎまちた☆\r\nドロフェス楽しすぎな！\r\n反省文ってもよき丸水産☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "83e505223e72eec73c44da5295e228316bc5b009501ade8653609f8783826f85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff4529b60fad208e1554f53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うあ～超春い～。\r\nゼファっちとか、そこら飛んでね？\r\nガチタンポポいし…あ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d36dbc6b5f0c716beb8d40c715800c0240bd7f8be260ff999b1cb1627c5978e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a58f89b22c0404fe326c690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレぴ～制汗剤ない？\r\nジャケ暑すぎてゼロった！\r\nかーぴーて♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "7edc9aadae7b1f5cef2233f82d0815fff04da56aeae436c23d04c6f00c0a2721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d3a1019d3962c951bd763ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねね！バンちゃむしらん？ほら、\r\n最近イベ続きで鬼疲れっぽくて？\r\nハグって元気したげよーって☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "46d56668c23702d5cdaaacaac64bebb65aefb43f018c0b7d052ecd0ef82928e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feab2272713f3006e36c906c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬は朝シチ☆これガチな！\r\n一生オネム～で『ん゛』って顔\r\nしてんの！鬼かわちぃ♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab89b3714dd6f32a69266deebf604df7660c413ae913e982a7ef39080a2b4f68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6497d55500cba63c58c7bde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "てか踊るなら暗いとこ行かん？\r\n衣装ピカらせ隊長命令☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cdcfd671ee325c596bd435827749863a90e420555633950ab8d7dd187cbfcd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33446c2bf79b94a8b1ff358d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うにゃ～！鳩捕まらん！\r\nウチも帽子からバサりたい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fe84216efb4aa858a6f9808e0fb92fd296a87cfe8700b1a89b7a6e8fa669b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07adc915ead8853acf5b853c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇～总算能跑步了！\r\n我等不及了☆连上课时也一直在\r\n笔记本上画线，想象自己在跑步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "001140ea6aff31e8b19d7325f5f8e4700c835b635764791a0172c7c4eae3a0a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9592d720dd54de6f93eb76a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アゲていくよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b51b437c5fa3b01e1ed384d22cbdd1db356529e9831fa9332bc4f373d28d7462",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcdd9bff0bbd629683e67440",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟阿训的合照被狂按赞！\r\n在开始训练前PO一张新的吧。\r\n总之先比个倒V耶～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "449b88dd0fdcb21b900dfe0ad8d563b741e12518f05f6614b8270783141cdd17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ef4b58f8f81e63698c34549",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "找一百名选手来比模拟赛怎样！？\r\n把闸门和赛道都拓宽～\r\n不妙，这祭典也太嗨了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb59c2034a0d1a1e4283b43cff3f99bfa6fd06d7976054cea0d4794bc3a2b3f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0333fef6ce978ba6ab7b4807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿训要一起跑吗？\r\n短距离应该还好吧！\r\n绝对会很嗨☆一起跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dad8619578237811b4848a122c8124375bab7c8eda091c542d16088c0eec0e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ce6408bf5c1c2cb5d1b20e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员是让我嗨起来的专家，\r\n这点我很清楚～☆\r\n今天要用什么让我嗨起来！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "985159b62025a46558a65c5b8bc901b40b55fefbd77cac2824195069d34e47f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bdec1f9665e403c60a6f97b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸，你有发现吗！？\r\n刚才放的那首，是DJ太阳神remix！\r\n……你听过了？我想也是～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bd2ce91be4335bcc48fd5961f270ac224a09874bb76815000bb96878f0e150c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa827a7249477b9cab9a407f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本来想说要嗨一波嗨一辈子啦～\r\n但现在觉得如果有阿训在\r\n应该办得到。是一定要做到☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b2fbe5f560b039fb5f9a6ff2d6fe91a01297a19370dc3a173b4b9c38491e2fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2596ceaf486d0277c5974579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海！祭典！烟火派对～！\r\n很嗨吧，全都想玩吧，\r\n超棒的对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b7768b38d69aec299c328c075884be6c41cd46c0d322d5a181a7990a1df131e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0072254db537e662588a6c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テンアゲ衣装着てっし？\r\nとりまEDMっとくか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0941f3e8787ad8558ffc31085f15ae83650bdf79142ce3a12a6ecad741fbfbe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c842ef9ea0ba6d33ec5e6e79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねぇねぇ！準備体操！ダンスど？\r\nウマトックで鬼バズってたヤツ\r\nあんだけど！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb8047863cfcf056378af7f04c342c191f1c1bc090dabab43be4e0c9f3dfe00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ccef43083a72777bb2f0a45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレぴ～トレメ決まった！？\r\nんじゃ、はよいこヒアウィゴ☆\r\n…はい！エスコーぴっ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1577273b03118fdc6aef21efb0e1729b350e6954067dbad9d18b27eef136e16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc88e0e6bb56d7aea670b8d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気晴らしに踊らん？\r\nてかリフトしてみん！？\r\n鬼飛ばす自信、ありぴ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "088f83d559e128c4e0c4a6a5df43060bd216eeff03dbfcf124466651a96ad54d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcf32153538a91b6715e0022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "たまにはシュっとした\r\nちゃんヘリもいいっしょ？\r\nウチもしゅきぴ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d244cfac4673ce4ec336fed1c20a9db9a762331f9b01e98d3a412bf513c468f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf53c0103c7ac64ed5263f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お悩みなう的な？なら一旦踊んべ！\r\nお手を拝借、チェケって1曲☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a3af63907c90ad40ee4f85959b1cd6e65d2d262ffb3876b69922a567f96e14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1899d48f04ada3cdc8823519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "難しいことわからんケド、ゆーて\r\nトレぴのリードは世界一だし？\r\n勝つしかアリエンティヌス☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "687ebdf015d0f63cb7982929acccddfa6a232b89ed592e6488f5ad2cffa3565f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1b7e8291c71ca38a7918596",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿训果然最棒了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "14aa02739c70461e4346d36707e1bfa0198e507b37022b6e1201139423753373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4109bb2630465e9a36697e8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "3Q水产特雷森学园分店☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "16beb489c524a91c72eb92cdc446bbefab586f5be14e01c166d192ec86520d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b749e541bad2f99eea2862a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一生ウチと！シャルウィーフェス☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f673237661937d1c625d7dce6b348d7c9ce7f2c841d0aa3da9e0ee8c08304d64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c0a42c2880a08bea0815736",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレぴのリード、神超えて愛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18183a97e3de05fa34fbc2b1b7b0b111f07bacc79726c7bb47c25ffecf4423b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80f3bd5cb886714f652ca0c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "配って！　アゲて！　ぽぽぽぽーん☆\r\nアゲの果てまで行っちゃってーー！！　ウェーーイ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a35c21304f79abf47e2352497a4677a976a11674205c99d3651b97a4aeb13f9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba11f94c7d8f2376d8a44097",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とりまお疲れ～☆　てかアガりヤバ。フェス超えて\r\n宇宙じゃん。こりゃごほーびもヤバっしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bab674df8b65595d676ee2d7cc8cbc208c5154e3dd1c788a79a29aa37f1bc6f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebe99315c4a8eec1af98c416",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉神嗨啊☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb9394b9a35f45afa8bc1ea12934d148b13ef61785b63b33fb30b4c674774a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32b591b48da9ee57ac90dc7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不止很神，根本就是神了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6be47d62a82cb7ef78d8dd80d6783dbaa27255d001f4adfcf9489293b00d784e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a046650df6b3fe54365cace",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔耶！\r\n非大拓太阳神莫属啦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9757111c1467deb45f2ab2552c3bf929d434246c758e607d10acf6c6d691cfbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de2efad0c3c031d21d1a0f09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最＆棒＆超嗨！\r\n嗨一波尽情吵闹吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7acddc96adb472df7421784eeee8abdcd3776a19f46ad6eeb6e6f358fbed02f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
